## Code Example

```javascript
// Example: basic attachment validation skeleton
function validateAttachment(file) {
  if (file.size > MAX_SIZE) return false;
  const mime = detectMime(file); // by magic bytes
  if (!ALLOWED_MIMES.includes(mime)) return false;
  // additional checks: zip slip, nested archives, etc.
